    "summaryAr": "About Blockvora Blockvora is scaling its engineering capacity with 5 new Full Stack Blockchain Engineer positions for the real-world asset (RWA) market. Operating as a fully remote team across the globe, we build infrastructure that bridges traditional finance and decentralized ledgers. Your responsibilities You will design, develop, and maintain decentralized applications and smart contracts that power our RWA marke",
    "descriptionAr": "About Blockvora Blockvora is scaling its engineering capacity with 5 new Full Stack Blockchain Engineer positions for the real-world asset (RWA) market. Operating as a fully remote team across the globe, we build infrastructure that bridges traditional finance and decentralized ledgers. Your responsibilities You will design, develop, and maintain decentralized applications and smart contracts that power our RWA marketplace. Write secure, gas-optimized smart contracts for asset tokenization. Build responsive front-end interfaces using modern web frameworks. Integrate blockchain networks with backend services and APIs. Audit and test codebase security to protect user assets and transactions. Collaborate with product and design teams to ship new protocol features. Requirements Proven professional experience in full stack software development and blockchain engineering. Strong proficiency in Solidity and JavaScript or TypeScript. Deep understanding of token standards, DeFi protocols, and Web3 libraries. Experience with modern front-end frameworks like React or Next.js. Familiarity with secure smart contract development practices and automated testing tools. Your first months at Blockvora In your first months, you will have taken on core smart contract development tasks, integrated critical front-end components for the RWA platform, and shipped your first protocol upgrades. You will have built a deep familiarity with our codebase and collaborated with distributed team members across international time zones. Compensation This is a 12-month freelance contract offering USD 80–140 per hour for 30 hours per week. Join us If your background matches most of these requirements, we encourage you to apply. Help us shape the infrastructure for tokenized real-world assets worldwide. Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow",
